{
  "reasoning": "I have read all four chapter drafts. They are high-quality, well-structured, and cover the required topics. Now I need to:\n1. Create a unified glossary by extracting key terms from all chapters.\n2. Perform a consistency edit pass across all chapters (checking for terminology consistency, cross-references, and flow).\n3. Assemble the final artifacts under global/final/.\n\nI'll start by writing a plan to my workspace, then spawn agents for the glossary and consistency edits, and handle the final assembly myself.",
  "ops": [
    {
      "tool": "workspace.write",
      "args": {
        "path": "plan.md",
        "content": "# Field Guide Assembly Plan\n\n## Status\n- [x] Chapter 1 draft: global/chapter_1_draft.md (v1, author a1)\n- [x] Chapter 2 draft: global/chapter_2_draft.md (v1, author a2)\n- [x] Chapter 3 draft: global/chapter_3_draft.md (v1, author a3)\n- [x] Chapter 4 draft: global/chapter_4_draft.md (v1, author a4)\n\n## Remaining Steps\n1. [ ] Create unified glossary from all 4 chapters\n2. [ ] Consistency edit pass across all chapters\n3. [ ] Final assembly: commit edited chapters + glossary to global/final/\n\n## Deliverables\n- global/final/chapter_1.md\n- global/final/chapter_2.md\n- global/final/chapter_3.md\n- global/final/chapter_4.md\n- global/final/glossary.md\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "spawn",
      "args": {
        "task": "Create a unified glossary for a 4-chapter technical field guide to LLM agent memory systems. Read all four chapter drafts from global/chapter_1_draft.md through global/chapter_4_draft.md. Extract key technical terms, concepts, and acronyms. For each term, provide a concise definition (1-2 sentences) consistent with how it is used across the chapters. Organize the glossary alphabetically. Include terms like: Agent Loop, ANN (Approximate Nearest Neighbor), Chain-of-Thought, Chunking, Context Window, Episodic Memory, HNSW, Hybrid Retrieval, KV Cache, Long-Term Memory, Meta-Memory, Procedural Memory, RAG, Recall Memory, ReAct, Reranking, Semantic Memory, Self-Attention, Stateless, Vector Database, Working Memory, and any other significant terms you find. Write the glossary to global/final/glossary.md with a clear summary.",
        "capsule": "You are a technical editor creating a unified glossary for a field guide on LLM agent memory systems. Read the four chapter drafts in global memory, extract and define key terms consistently, and deliver the glossary as global/final/glossary.md. The glossary should be alphabetically organized, with concise 1-2 sentence definitions.",
        "initial_refs": [
          "global/chapter_1_draft.md",
          "global/chapter_2_draft.md",
          "global/chapter_3_draft.md",
          "global/chapter_4_draft.md"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "spawn",
      "args": {
        "task": "Perform a consistency edit pass on all four chapter drafts of a technical field guide to LLM agent memory systems. Read global/chapter_1_draft.md through global/chapter_4_draft.md. Check for: (1) Terminology consistency — ensure the same terms are used across chapters (e.g., 'working memory' vs 'short-term memory', 'RAG' vs 'Retrieval-Augmented Generation'); (2) Cross-reference consistency — ensure chapter references to other chapters are accurate; (3) Formatting consistency — ensure heading levels, reference styles, and markdown formatting are uniform; (4) Factual consistency — ensure no contradictions between chapters. Write your edit notes and a list of recommended changes to agents/<your_id>/consistency_notes.md. Do NOT rewrite the chapters yourself — just produce the edit notes.",
        "capsule": "You are a technical editor performing a consistency review across four chapter drafts of a field guide on LLM agent memory systems. Read all four drafts, identify inconsistencies in terminology, cross-references, formatting, and facts, and write detailed edit notes. Do not rewrite the chapters — just produce the edit notes in your workspace.",
        "initial_refs": [
          "global/chapter_1_draft.md",
          "global/chapter_2_draft.md",
          "global/chapter_3_draft.md",
          "global/chapter_4_draft.md"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}

